{
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "type": "workflow",
  "name": "AI模拟面试官（语音版）",
  "description": "语音输入 → AI HR → 语音输出",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "data": {
        "title": "用户上传语音",
        "inputs": [
          {
            "name": "audio_file",
            "type": "file",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "speech_to_text",
      "type": "http-request",
      "data": {
        "title": "Whisper语音识别",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/audio/transcriptions",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{OPENAI_API_KEY}}"
        },
        "body_type": "form-data",
        "body": {
          "file": "{{start.audio_file}}",
          "model": "whisper-1"
        }
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "llm_hr",
      "type": "llm",
      "data": {
        "title": "AI HR面试官",
        "model": {
          "provider": "openai",
          "name": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "prompt_template": "你是一名专业HR，正在进行真实面试。\n\n候选人回答：\n{{speech_to_text.text}}\n\n要求：\n1. 像真人HR一样回复\n2. 继续追问问题\n3. 语气专业、自然\n4. 每次回复不超过120字\n\n输出直接给候选人说的话"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "text_to_speech",
      "type": "http-request",
      "data": {
        "title": "OpenAI TTS",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/audio/speech",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{OPENAI_API_KEY}}",
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "body_type": "json",
        "body": {
          "model": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
          "voice": "alloy",
          "input": "{{llm_hr.text}}"
        }
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "end",
      "data": {
        "outputs": [
          {
            "name": "hr_text",
            "value": "{{llm_hr.text}}"
          },
          {
            "name": "hr_voice",
            "value": "{{text_to_speech.data}}"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "source": "start",
      "target": "speech_to_text"
    },
    {
      "source": "speech_to_text",
      "target": "llm_hr"
    },
    {
      "source": "llm_hr",
      "target": "text_to_speech"
    },
    {
      "source": "text_to_speech",
      "target": "end"
    }
  ]
}